    <string name="guide_content">
        Isikhombisi Ngesinyathelo\n
        1. Khetha isithombe sephrofayili esicacile nesifanelekile\n
        - Sebenzisa isithombe esisezingeni eliphezulu noma ilogo yobungcweti.\n
        - Qinisekisa ukuthi isithombe sicacile futhi sibonisa ubuso bakho.\n
        - Gwema izithombe ezingacacile noma ezisezingeni eliphansi.\n
        2. Bhala Isihloko Esinamandla\n
        - Yenza sifushane, sichaze, futhi ukhombise ikhono lakho eliyinhloko.\n
        Isibonelo: “Umklami Wezithombe Onguchwepheshe | Amalogo Nezisombululo Zokumaketha”\n
        Amathiphu Ochwepheshe:\n
        - Gxila ekucaceni nasekubuchule.\n
        - Sebenzisa amagama angukhiye amakhasimende angawasesha.\n
        - Yiba noqobo mayelana namakhono akho nesikhathi sokulethwa.
    </string>

